                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content"
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "ws-ms-p1",
                          "kind": "text",
                          "text": "凌晨一点，夜航小馆的后厨还亮着灯。阿哲在挑第二锅骨汤，勺子提起来，汤面上那层油光要刚好能挂住。",
                          "fontSize": "$text-caption",
                          "fontWeight": 400,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                          "lineHeight": {
                            "unit": "multiplier",
                            "value": 1.85
                          },
                          "wrap": "width",
                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content"
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "ws-ms-p2",
                          "kind": "text",
                          "text": "「深夜的客人不挑味道，挑的是有没有人等。」门外刚坐下第三拨客人——代驾、下夜班的护士、抱着电脑改方案的设计师。",
                          "fontSize": "$text-caption",
                          "fontWeight": 400,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                          "lineHeight": {
                            "unit": "multiplier",
                            "value": 1.85
                          },
                          "wrap": "width",
                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content"
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "ws-ms-p3",
                          "kind": "text",
                          "text": "这一季把关门时间从 23 点挪到凌晨 2 点，菜单只加了两个热菜。生意不是变多了，是变长了。",
                          "fontSize": "$text-caption",
                          "fontWeight": 400,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                          "lineHeight": {
                            "unit": "multiplier",
                            "value": 1.85
                          },
                          "wrap": "width",
                          "fill": "$color-ink",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content"
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "ws-ms-p4",
                          "kind": "text",
                          "text": "阿哲说不用写得太漂亮，「你就写我们每天怎么等」。所以这篇里没有一个形容词是我编的。",
                          "fontSize": "$text-caption",
                          "fontWeight": 400,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                          "lineHeight": {
                            "unit": "multiplier",
                            "value": 1.85
